      "translation": "Let us be scholars and men of letters and equal in consciousness with the western and eastern believers."
    },
    {
      "verse_no": 21,
      "translation": "They have presented the 'pride of historical narratives' by creating a dialogue with a dialectical passage of time, lowering him from his special historical position."
    },
    {
